  "body": "In the [check if enforcing report-only COOP would require a browsing context group switch](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#check-bcg-switch-navigation-report-only) algorithm, we keep referring to `activeDocumentCOOPReportOnly`, however, the parameter is named `activeDocumentCOOP`.\r\n\r\nI think we should rename `activeDocumentCOOPReportOnly` in the algorithm to `activeDocumentCOOP`.",
